column8:
Five agents are checking my draft answer before I send it. They're working on: 
 - what real Claude Code and Codex sessions record (TraceLab); 
 - what signals harnesses like Claude Code expose; 
 - what the replay and engine would need to change. 

 Two more are attacking the draft: one crit

I've added the campaign 18 analysis to `ORACLE_FINDINGS.md`: 
 - a new section 9.10 with the table and the evidence; 
 - short notes in the summary, in section 9.7 (where the gap was marked "not analysed") and in the trust caveats (§10); 
 - open issue 8 now points to 9.10; issue 5 explains what
